   "stem": {
      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = -1 \\) are \\( f(-1) = 2 \\), \\( f'(-1) = 0 \\), \\( f''(-1) = 6 \\), \\( f'''(-1) = -4 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = -1 \\)."
   },
